## 7. Conclusion
Week 4 established a machine learning workflow for logistics delivery-risk prediction, including preprocessing, model training, evaluation, comparison, and model persistence. The evaluation results should guide model selection and future improvements.

## 8. Future Improvements
- Investigate additional leakage risks and validate that every feature would be available at prediction time.
- Tune model hyperparameters and evaluate class-specific errors.
- Test the model on newer or independent data.
- Explore route or shipment optimization using operational constraints where suitable.
